gs unparalleled convenience and precision directly into your hands.\n\n# Key Features:\n- **3D Precision:** Effortlessly measure distances, angles, curves, and surface areas with pinpoint accuracy in an immersive 3D environment.\n- **Intuitive Interaction:** VR tools attach for fluid, natural movement. Simply pick up the tools within the virtual space and start measuring without cumbersome hardware setups.\n\n\n- **Versitile Use Cases:** From interior design and architecture to educational demonstrations and creative prototyping, AR-Toolkit adapts to a wide variety of professional and personal projects.\n- **Real-Time Visualization:** See your measurements update instantly in augmented reality. Make quick adjustments to angles and layouts with confidence.\n- **User-Friendly Interface:** A clean and intuitive interface keeps the learning curve low, enabling anyone\u2014from hobbyists to professionals\u2014to get started immediately.\n\n\n", "short_description": "Experience a new dimension of measurement with AR-Toolkit, an augmented reality application designed to measure distances, angles, curves, and areas in real-time 3D space. Leveraging cutting-edge VR tools attached to body sockets, AR-Toolkit brings unparalleled convenience and precision directly into your hands."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/theMatthewNewman/ar-toolkit/blob/main/privacyPolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Matthew Newman", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ar-toolkit.web.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_